  "notes": "{進|すす}める means to advance, move forward, or promote something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{進|すす}む→進む：01225_susumu⟧ (intransitive - to advance, proceed)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{計画|けいかく}→計画：01172_keikaku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{進|すす}める: to advance a plan\n- ⟦{話|はなし}→話：01496_hanashi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{進|すす}める: to move the discussion forward\n- ⟦{準備|じゅんび}→準備：01431_junbi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{進|すす}める: to proceed with preparations\n- ⟦{仕事|しごと}→仕事：00480_shigoto⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{進|すす}める: to move work forward\n- ⟦{交渉|こうしょう}→交渉：02727_koushou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{進|すす}める: to advance negotiations\n\nHOMOPHONE DISTINCTION:\n- {進|すす}める: to advance, promote (this entry)\n- ⟦{勧|すす}める→勧める：02120_susumeru⟧: to recommend\n- ⟦{薦|すす}める→薦める：27814_susumeru⟧: to recommend (person for a position)",
